                </h2>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    {popularServices.map((pop) => (
                        <a href={`/services/${pop}/`}
                           class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-black/[0.04] dark:bg-white/[0.05] text-xs mono font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 hover:bg-indigo-500/12 transition-all">
                            {pop.toUpperCase()}
                        </a>
                    ))}
                    <a href="/services/" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/12 text-xs mono font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 hover:bg-indigo-600 hover:text-white transition-all">
                        All Services &rarr;
                    </a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-4">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                    Frequently Asked Questions
                </h2>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl soft-card">
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                            What is the latest update for AWS {serviceUpper} in Boto3?
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed break-words">
                            {changes[0] ? `The latest update for ${serviceUpper} was added in Boto3 release ${changes[0].v}: ${changes[0].t}` : `No recent changes logged for ${serviceUpper}.`}
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl soft-card">
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                            How do I filter Boto3 release notes for {serviceUpper}?
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed break-words">
                            Use BotoView at <a href={`/?s=${service}`} class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 underline font-semibold">botoview.5goos.com/?s={service}</a> to search, filter, and compare all {serviceUpper} SDK changes across Boto3 and Botocore.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl soft-card">
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                            How do I install the latest Boto3 with {serviceUpper} support?
