                        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                            Upgrade your Python Boto3 library using pip:
                            <code class="block mt-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-black/[0.04] dark:bg-white/[0.05] mono text-xs text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 font-medium overflow-x-auto">
                                pip install --upgrade boto3
                            </code>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>

        <footer class="relative z-10 mt-auto py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-transparent">
